  "version": "0.11.0-alpha.4",
  "notes": "## 0.11.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-22\n\n### Features\n\n- UniClipboard can now check for updates in the background and when the app is opened, and can show a system notification when a new version is available (#823)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep the update indicator and update dialog accurate after background checks, including the installed version, release notes, release date, and download status (#823)\n- Fix Finder file copies that could sometimes be missing from clipboard history, especially for files with thumbnails or custom icons (#821)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.11.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-22\n\n### Features\n\n- UniClipboard 现在可以在后台和打开应用时检查更新，并在发现新版本时显示系统通知 (#823)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复后台检查更新后，更新入口和更新窗口中的已安装版本、发行说明、发布日期与下载状态可能不准确的问题 (#823)\n- 修复从 Finder 复制文件后，剪贴板历史偶尔缺少该记录的问题，尤其是带缩略图或自定义图标的文件 (#821)",
